  "description": "Dart Plus is the ultimate bike for big kids who are ready to explore beyond the cul-de-sac. Designed with premium features that show them what their first grown-up bike will be like, Dart Plus gives kids a head start on mastering adult-level riding. With a lightweight aluminum frame, kid-specific geometry, and 50mm front suspension fork, the riding is smooth and handling is a breeze. A Shimano 7-speed drivetrain and twist-grip shifters give them the tools to master hills and longer rides, while front & rear Tektro mechanical disc brakes pack serious stopping power for ultimate control. Designed with growing riders in mind, Dart Plus offers an ergonomic fit, adjustable height, and cushy, shock-absorbing tires for all-day comfort. It’s more than just a bigger kids bike – it’s their ticket to better, bolder bike rides.",
